      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "originalExcerpt": "若 n≥4，则 n−2>1 且 n−2<n，这与 n 的最小性矛盾。",
        "leanEvidenceExcerpt": "  have source_step_4 :\n      ((n : ZMod p) - 1) = 0 → 4 ≤ n → False := by",
